- Add GET /api/reports/materials/waste (per-material spoilage % from
  logged waste/damage adjustment rows, not a fabricated yield estimate)
- Add MaterialsReconciliationPrintLayout + wire Print/Export button on
  the Month-End Reconciliation report (previously no print path existed)
- Add PUT /api/materials/transactions/<id> for inline edit; wire Edit/
  Delete buttons and edit-mode form in Materials.jsx (previously delete
  had no UI either, and edit meant delete-and-recreate)
- Replace raw numeric Job ID field in RecordMaterialTransactionModal
  with a searchable <input list>/<datalist> field, matching the
  existing client-search pattern used elsewhere
- Rename sales.jsx/pettycash.jsx -> Sales.jsx/PettyCash.jsx to match
  their imports in App.jsx (was silently fine on Windows/Mac, breaks
  on any case-sensitive/Linux deploy)
- Fix InvoicePDF.jsx's InvoiceDocument: discount_amount was dropped
  entirely from the PDF total calc (subtotal -> VAT -> total, no
  discount step) while the sibling ProposalDocument in the same file
  did it correctly; now matches both ProposalDocument and the backend's
  invoice_totals(). Also fixed the same gap in the (currently unused)
  NewInvoiceModal so it won't reproduce this if wired up later.

Confirmed already complete, no changes needed:
- Proposal.priority/assigned_staff_id already real columns,
  accept_proposal() already carries them into the created Job
  (verified live via HTTP: create proposal -> accept -> Job.priority
  matches)
- pages/Jobs.jsx orphaned duplicate does not exist in this checkout

Left open, need input:
- config.py bank account_number is still a placeholder (1234567890)
- Income Statement tab vs. report-suite PDF spec not re-checked -
  the actual spec PDF isn't in this repo (uploaded to a chat session
  previously, never committed) and can't be reconstructed from the
  higher-level roadmap PDF that is in log files/

Verified: py_compile on all backend files touched; PUT and waste-report
routes exercised live over HTTP against seeded data (edit persisted,
validation rejects bad transaction_type/count+job_id, delete still
works); esbuild JSX transform clean on all frontend files touched.
